{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it, move it to a destination, do a specific task, or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsTaskNeeded    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
